{
  "category": "Spikes Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Its massive bones are 1000 times harder than human bones. It can easily knock a trailer flying.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its massive bones are 1000 times harder than human bones. It can easily knock a trailer flying.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "A POKéMON with a one-track mind. Once it charges, it won't stop running until it falls asleep.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is inept at turning because of its four short legs. It can only charge and run in one direction.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "It doesn't care if there is anything in its way. It just charges and destroys all obstacles.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "It can remember only one thing at a time. Once it starts rushing, it forgets why it started.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "RHYHORN runs in a straight line, smashing everything in its path. It is not bothered even if it rushes headlong into a block of steel. This POKéMON may feel some pain from the collision the next day, however.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "RHYHORN’s brain is very small. It is so dense, while on a run it forgets why it started running in the first place. It apparently remembers sometimes if it demolishes something.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once it starts running, it doesn’t stop. Its tiny brain makes it so stupid that it can’t remember why it started running in the first place.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "Strong, but not too bright, this POKéMON can shatter even a skyscraper with its charging TACKLES.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its massive bones are 1,000 times harder than human bones. Its TACKLE can knock a semitrailer flying.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its body is clad in a thick hide, and its tackles topple buildings. Unfortunately, it is not smart.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its body is clad in a thick hide, and its tackles topple buildings. Unfortunately, it is not smart.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its powerful tackles can destroy anything. However, it is too slow witted to help people work.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is inept at turning because of its four short legs. It can only charge and run in one direction.",
      "version": "heartgold"
    },
    {
      "text": "It doesn’t care if there is anything in its way. It just charges and destroys all obstacles.",
      "version": "soulsilver"
